  dialogues:
    _serializedList:
    - Key: CONNIE_Hello
      Value:
      - "<wave><color=red>Hey, pal.,</color>\nTest\n\xA4<wave><color=red>TestTwo</color>"
      - Bonjour
    - Key: ABBIE_Hello
      Value:
      - Hi... I'm new here. I hope everything is alright?
      - Bonjour
    - Key: MAX_Hello
      Value:
      - Good morning!
      - Bonjour
    - Key: ROSA_Hello
      Value:
      - Hello dear!
      - "Bonjour mon ch\xE9rie"
    - Key: LI_Hello
      Value:
      - "Oh. You\u2019re new. Uh\u2026 hi."
      - "Hey pal!\xA4Nice one the other day. Very funny.\xA4\u2026Don\u2019t do that
        again.\xA4But hey. No offense taken.\xA4\u2026\xA4So! Met any new friends?\xA4Not
        much like you\u2019re spoiled for choice. It\u2019s only the four of us here.\xA4\u2026Five
        if you count Esteban; though the guy doesn\u2019t talk much.\xA4Ahem neither
        does Devi to be honest.\xA4And Max\u2026 she\u2019s probably the worst of
        the bunch.\xA4All smiles and just ready to plant a dagger in your back when
        you least expect it.\xA4Again I\u2019d be wary of who you trust. It\u2019s
        a shark tank here and you wouldn\u2019t believe the lengths some people go
        just to earn a promotion.\xA4Glad you\u2019re one of the good ones!"
    - Key: DEVI_Hello
      Value:
      - "\u2026What? Is there something on my face?"
      - 
    - Key: ESTEBAN_One
      Value:
      - "So...<!shake>\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Smile>How are y-<!wait=0.2>you d<!wait=0.5>...\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default><!wait=0.5>.<!wait=0.5>.<!wait=0.5>.<!sprite=Pissed>Nevermind.\n\n\xA4<!drop>Backlog."
      - 
    - Key: ESTEBAN_Two
      Value:
      - ".<!wait=0.25>.<!wait=0.25>.<!wait=0.25>.<!wait=0.25>.<!wait=0.25>.<!wait=0.25>\n\n\xA4Ahem...\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Pissed>.<!wait=0.25>.<!wait=0.25>.\n\n\xA4Backlog.<!drop>"
      - 
    - Key: ESTEBAN_Three
      Value:
      - "Backlog.<!drop>\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Smile>Also,<!wait=0.5> I-<!wait=0.5> I hope
        you're...\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default><!wait=0.5>.<!wait=0.5>.<!wait=0.5>.<!sprite=Pissed>Nevermind."
      - 
    - Key: ESTEBAN_Four
      Value:
      - TODO
      - 
    - Key: LI_One
      Value:
      - "Oh.<!wait=0.75> You\u2019re<!sprite=Glasses> new.<!sprite=Default>\n\n\xA4Uh\u2026\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Glasses>Hi.<!drop>"
      - 
    - Key: LI_Two
      Value:
      - "Oh,<!wait=0.5> you\u2019re here?\n\n\xA4Sorry,<!wait=0.5> didn\u2019t really
        notice you.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Glasses>I was thinking about the \n150 new-punton
        fusion.\n\n\xA4Actually,<!wait=0.5> I believe I could \nreach 200 soon.\n\n\xA4.<!wait=0.5>.<!wait=0.5>.<!wait=0.5><!sprite=Default>What?\n\n\xA4What
        do you mean,<!wait=0.5> you\u2019re not aware\nof what a \"new-punton\" is?\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Glasses>A
        new-punton is <i>obviously</i> the \nequivalent of 2000 old-punton\u2026\n\n\xA4.<!wait=0.5>.<!wait=0.5>.<!wait=0.5>I
        thought they\u2019d brief \nyou on it.<!wait=0.5> How weird."
      - 
    - Key: CONNIE_One
      Value:
      - "<!sprite=Happy>Hey,<!wait=0.5> fella!\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>You\u2019re
        new here,<!wait=0.5>\nam I right?\n\n\xA4.<!wait=0.2>.<!wait=0.2>.<!wait=0.2>eh,<!wait=0.5>
        who am I kidding.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Happy>'Whole floor knows about\nour little
        newcomer!\n\n\xA4Sorry,<!wait=0.5> 'guess that wasn\u2019t the\nwarm welcome
        you expected\u2026\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>Ah,<!wait=0.75> don\u2019t blame
        them.<!wait=0.75>\nEverybody\u2019s on edge lately.<!wait=0.5>\n\n\xA4Thought
        I\u2019d at least come by\nand greet you properly.<!wait=0.25>\n\n\xA4Anyway,<!wait=0.5>
        took enough of your time.<!drop>\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Happy>See you tomorrow,
        <!wait=0.15>pal!"
      - 
    - Key: CONNIE_Two_Good
      Value:
      - "Hey,<!wait=0.5> pal!\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Happy>Thanks for covering \nmy ass
        yesterday.\n\n\xA4Knew you were \na real mate.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>Really
        appreciate it.<!wait=0.5> And you \nknow I\u2019ll return the favour.<!drop>\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Happy>So!<!wait=0.5>
        Met any new friends?\n\n\xA4Saw you talking with Max earlier.<!wait=1>\nI\u2019d
        be careful in your place.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>All smiles,<!wait=0.5>
        and just ready to plant a dagger \nin your back when you least expect it.\n\n\xA4Again,<!wait=0.5>
        I\u2019d be wary of who you trust. \n\n\xA4It\u2019s a shark tank here,<!wait=0.5>
        and you wouldn\u2019t believe \nthe lengths some people go just to earn a
        promotion.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Happy>Glad you\u2019re one of the good ones!"
      - 
    - Key: CONNIE_Two_Bad
      Value:
      - "Hey,<!wait=0.5> pal!\n\n\xA4Nice one the other day.\n<!sprite=Happy>Very
        funny.\n\n\xA4.<!wait=0.4>.<!wait=0.4>.<!wait=0.4><color=orange><!sprite=Surprised>don\u2019t
        do that again?\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>But hey. \nNo offence taken.<!drop>\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Happy>So!<!wait=0.5>
        Met any new friends?\n\n\xA4Saw you talking with Max earlier.<!wait=1>\nI\u2019d
        be careful in your place.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>All smiles,<!wait=0.5>
        and just ready to plant a dagger \nin your back when you least expect it.\n\n\xA4Again,<!wait=0.5>
        I\u2019d be wary of who you trust. \n\n\xA4It\u2019s a shark tank here,<!wait=0.5>
        and you wouldn\u2019t believe \nthe lengths some people go just to earn a
        promotion.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Happy>Glad you\u2019re one of the good ones!"
      - 
    - Key: CONNIE _Three
      Value:
      - "Hey,<!wait=0.5><!sprite=Angry><color=orange> WHAT THE HELL?!</color>\n\n\xA4<b>I</b>'ve
        been in this company for so fucking long.\n\n\xA4<b>I</b><!wait=0.5> am the
        most proficient employee!\n\n\xA4<b>I</b><!wait=0.5> work harder than any
        of them!<!wait=0.5>\n\n\xA4<b>I</b><!wait=0.5> am the most deserving one
        of them all!<!wait=0.5>\n\n\xA4So<!wait=0.5>WHY<!wait=0.5> the <wave><!wait=0.5>****</wave><!wait=0.5>
        didn\u2019t <!wait=0.5>I<!wait=0.5> get a <!wait=0.5>GROWTH?\n\n\xA4<!wait=0.5>.<!wait=0.5>.<!wait=0.5>.<!wait=0.5>.<!wait=0.5>.<!wait=0.5>\n\n\xA4You.\n\n\xA4I've
        been friendly enough,<!wait=0.5> <color=orange>didn\u2019t I?</color>\n\n\xA4Even
        though you\u2019re a worthless little <wave>****.\n\n\xA4And how did you
        return the favor?\n\n\xA4By planting a dagger in my back?!\n\n\xA4But it\u2019s
        fine.<!wait=0.5> I\u2019ll get what \nI deserve, sooner or later.\n\n\xA4Mark
        my words,<!wait=0.5> 'cause when it happens\u2026\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default><b>I</b><!wait=0.5>
        will make your life even \nmore <b>miserable</b> than it already is. "
      - 
    - Key: MAX_One
      Value:
      - "Oh!<!wait=1><!sprite=Wink> Sorry for surprising you.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>I
        did not expect to see a new face here.<!wait=1>\nForgot you were replacing
        <!sprite=Serious><wave amplitude=3 uniformity=0.5><color=red>\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588<!sprite=Default><!wait=1>\n\n\xA4A
        shame. <!wait=1><wave amplitude=1 uniformity=0.5><color=red>She</color> was
        a fun one. <!wait=1><!sprite=Wink>Though I\u2019m \nsure you\u2019ll fit
        right in as well.<!drop>\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>You know,<!wait=0.5> I think
        you\u2019re gonna bring \nsome much-needed life up here.\n\n\xA4Floor was
        getting pretty dull \nwith only the four of us.\n\n\xA4.<!wait=0.25>.<!wait=0.25>.<!wait=0.5><!sprite=Serious>Five,<!wait=0.5>
        if you count Esteban,<!wait=0.5> \nthough the guy doesn\u2019t talk much.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Wink>Anyway,<!wait=0.5>
        nice to meet you! \n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>Don\u2019t worry,<!wait=0.5> I
        probably \nwon\u2019t make your job too hard. \n\n\xA4<!sprite=Wink>Haven\u2019t
        failed a single report ever since\nI joined,<!wait=0.5> and I well intend
        to continue!\n\n\xA4See you tomorrow!<!sprite=Default>"
      - 
    - Key: DEVI_One
      Value:
      - "<wave amplitude=3 uniformity=0.5><color=red>.<!wait=0.1>.<!wait=0.1>.<!wait=1>
        <!sprite=ShockTinfoil>W<!wait=0.1> H<!wait=0.1> A <!wait=0.1>T<!wait=0.1>
        ? \n\n\xA4<wave amplitude=3 uniformity=0.5><color=red>IS THERE SOMETHING
        \nON MY FACE?<!wait=1>\n\n\xA4<wave amplitude=3 uniformity=0.5><!sprite=DefaultTinfoil><color=red><!wait=0.4>.<!wait=0.4>.<!wait=0.4>.<color=red><!wait=0.75><!sprite=AngryTinfoil>TSK.<!drop>"
      - 
    - Key: DEVI_Two
      Value:
      - <color=red>DO.<!wait=0.5> NOT.<!wait=0.5>TRUST. <!wait=0.5>. HER.
      - 
    - Key: ABBIE_One
      Value:
      - "Err<!wait=0.25>.<!wait=0.25>.<!wait=0.25>. hi?\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Stressed>Sorry,<!wait=0.5>
        is this the right desk?<!wait=0.5>\nI\u2019m looking for<!wait=0.25>.<!wait=0.25>.<!wait=0.25>.
        <wave amplitude=1><color=#bf42f5>NURTURING</color>?\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Happy>Oh,<!wait=0.5>
        finally!\n\n\xA4I\u2019m supposed to give you this.<!wait=0.5>\nI hope it\u2019s
        all good?<!drop>\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>I only just joined.<!wait=0.5> Applied
        as \nsoon as I graduated. \n\n\xA4<!sprite=Happy>I\u2019m so glad I\u2019ll
        get to work\non the <color=#427ef5><wave>PANACEA</wave></color> project!\n\n\xA4You
        should see the stuff they got up in <wave amplitude=1><color=#bf42f5>R&D</color>.<!wait=1></wave>\nI\u2019d
        never seen anything like it.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Stressed>\u2026I\u2019m not
        really allowed to \ntalk about it,<!wait=0.5> though.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>Anyway,<!wait=0.5>
        got to go back to the <wave amplitude=1><color=#427ef5>lab.</color>\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Stressed>They\u2019re
        giving me a tour of the research\nfacilities,<!wait=0.5> and I think I\u2019m
        already late.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Depressed>This place is such a maze.\n\n\xA4Lost
        so much time finding my way here,<!wait=0.5>\nand still need to figure out
        the return trip.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Happy>Bye!"
      - 
    - Key: ABBIE_Two
      Value:
      - "<!sprite=DefaultPostIt>Hey, you!<!wait=1> How are you\ndoing since last
        time?\n\n\xA4<!sprite=StressedPostIt>Me?<!wait=1> Oh, I'm trying my best,\nbut
        there's so much to learn\u2026\n\n\xA4I really hope there\u2019s no issue
        with my form this time.<!drop>\n\n\xA4<!sprite=DepressedPostIt>My manager
        got pretty angry last time.\nHe wouldn't stop screaming at me.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=HappyPostIt>Hahaha.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=DepressedPostIt>I
        sure let him down...<!wait=2><!sprite=StressedPostIt>\nbut it won't happen
        again!\n\n\xA4<!sprite=HappyPostIt>I'll definitely fit in!"
      - 
    - Key: ROSALYNE_One
      Value:
      - "Hello, my dear!<!wait=1>\n\n\xA4What a wonderful place to be...<!wait=1>\n\n\xA4...<!wait=1>\n\n\xA4I
        heard there was a lot \nof tensions here.\n\n\xA4And so,<!wait=1> here I
        come to\nsoothe it all!\n\n\xA4It\u2019s the beginning of a brand new chapter
        for me.<!wait=0.5>\n\n\xA4And for us.<!wait=1.5>\n\n\xA4I am looking forward
        to working with you in the future!<!wait=1>\n\n\xA4I sincerely hope that
        we will develop<!wait=0.5> the best,<!wait=0.5> working environment possible.<!wait=1.5>\n\n\xA4So
        all of our coworkers will finally do their best.<!wait=1>\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Serious>It's
        important you know...<!wait=1.5>\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>It's for the best,<!wait=1>
        for everyone.<!wait=1>\n\n\xA4Having a work space where you feel free,<!wait=1>
        confident,<!wait=1> and loved.<!wait=2>\n\n\xA4Everyone feeling this way
        is really important to me!<!wait=1>\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Serious>It really is\u2026<!wait=1.5>\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Default>Once
        again,<!wait=1> I'm counting on you!<!wait=1><!drop>\n\n\xA4Bye bye!<!wait=1>"
      - 
    - Key: MAX_Two
      Value:
      - "Hey,<!wait=1><!sprite=Serious> I didn't get my promotion.\n\n\xA4I was wondering<!wait=1>
        why?<!wait=1>\n\nAnd it seems like\u2026<!wait=1>\n\n\xA4You would be the<!wait=1>
        \n\nsole<!wait=1> obstacle to that.\n\n\xA4But it must be a mistake\u2026\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Blink><!color=red>Right?</color><!wait=2>\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Serious>\u2026<!wait=2>\n\n\xA4Because,<!wait=1>
        if it was not.\n\n\xA4That would imply certain things.\n\n\xA4And I would
        have to take certain actions.\n\n\xA4You know...<!wait=2>\n\n\xA4So,<!wait=1>
        let's consider it\n\n\xA4A<!wait=0.5>.<!wait=0.5>.<!wait=0.5>. mistake<!wait=1>\n\n\xA4A<!wait=0.5>
        simple\u2026<!wait=1> and<!wait=1> idiot\u2026<!wait=1>\n\nmistake.\n\xA4It
        happens,<!wait=1> haha!\n\n\xA4But it happens once.<!wait=1>\n\n\xA4Because\u2026<!wait=0.5>\n\nYou
        know\u2026<!wait=0.5>\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Angry>I can't allow a pig<!wait=1>
        \n\nto prejudice my PERFECT career.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Serious>And if it were
        to happen again.\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Blink><!color=red>Let's just say that I
        love<!wait=1>\n\nthe screams of a bleeding pig.</color>\n\n\xA4<!sprite=Serious>Bye!<!drop>\n"
      - 
